    <string name="api_docs_body">Acción: com.nitsutech.smartfan.ACTION_COMMAND\nBroadcast de estado: com.nitsutech.smartfan.ACTION_STATE_CHANGED\n\nExtras:\n• action: fan_toggle | fan_on | fan_off | fan_speed | fan_speed_up | fan_speed_down | fan_mode | fan_shake | fan_reversal | fan_timer | light_toggle | light_on | light_off | light_ct | light_brightness | light_preset | night_light | aux_light | rgb | auto_color | meteor | all_off | select_device | get_state\n• value: ej. \"4\", \"90\", \"night\", \"ff00aa\"\n• device: ID o nombre opcional\n\nPrueba ADB:\nadb shell am broadcast -a com.nitsutech.smartfan.ACTION_COMMAND -n com.nitsutech.smartfan/.receiver.SmartFanCommandReceiver --es action fan_toggle</string>
